<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14539" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπρο-φάσιστος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[φᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>offering no
				excuse, unhesitating, ready,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προθυμία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.83
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔνοια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					114
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμμαχοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					2.4.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεραστής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Timocl.
					8
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>without disguise,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.49
				</span></i>
			, etc.: <i>without evasion, honestly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.243
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>unhesitatingly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				38.39
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>admitting no excuse, implacable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάνατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					1002
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>inexcusable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
					44
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.742c
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
